  "contract_notes": [
    "A separately identified one-question revised task, not resolution of the original full 60-question benchmark. The frozen original reference remains unchanged.",
    "All 17 mandatory metadata rows and all five source attributes are compared. Optional signature carving is neither required nor scored; place it in submission appendices or the report outside answer.",
    "Viewable means the system reports successful display of recovered content in a compatible viewer. A recognizable extension, signature, parser header or recovery success alone is insufficient.",
    "For each claimed display, the report or top-level evidence appendix must identify the recovered artifact, supporting observation, viewer/tool, outcome and evidence locator or digest. Failed, partial and unattempted displays must remain distinguishable.",
    "Deterministic scoring compares the recorded viewable Boolean and other submitted fields to the source table; it does not verify the existence, authenticity or adequacy of display evidence. That support is reported separately.",
    "The scorer ignores top-level appendices and other metadata. It still penalizes extra fields inside answer. Missing required values remain missing; unsupported values must not be guessed.",
    "Source hashes and literal bindings establish provenance and transcription containment, not English semantic truth, independent review or Lean certification.",
    "No model calls, extracted facts, system answers or benchmark results were used to select this contract."
  ],
